            <div xml:id="d13-a1">

                <pb facs="d13-01" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve13/d13-01"/>

                <p>Enclosures</p>
                <p>[Tab A]</p>
                <pb facs="d13-02" n="2" xml:id="d13-02"/>
                <p>The President wishes to call the attention of the Government of the People’s
                    Republic of China to the following matters:</p>
                <p>The U.S. Government has not replied formally to the Soviet proposal for a
                    conference of the five nuclear powers. It is transmitting an oral comment to the
                    Soviet Foreign Ministry through the U.S. Ambassador in Moscow along these
                    lines:</p>
                <p>The subject of nuclear disarmament is worthy of serious consideration. A
                    conference would require careful preparation and agreement among the five powers
                    as to what subjects were feasible for discussion. The views of non-nuclear
                    states should be considered. All five powers must be willing to attend.</p>
                <p>It is not anticipated that a formal reply will be made.</p>
            </div>
